<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1329432182"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:53.187"><div begin="41.587" end="57.079" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="41.587" end="45.143" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.587" end="42.061">曾经</span><span begin="42.061" end="43.005">真的以为</span><span begin="43.005" end="43.383">人</span><span begin="43.383" end="44.106">生就</span><span begin="44.106" end="45.143">这样了</span></p><p begin="45.351" end="49.080" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.351" end="46.096">平静的</span><span begin="46.096" end="46.585">心</span><span begin="46.585" end="47.137">拒绝</span><span begin="47.137" end="47.723">再</span><span begin="47.723" end="48.276">有浪</span><span begin="48.276" end="49.080">潮</span></p><p begin="49.525" end="53.185" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="49.525" end="50.390">斩了千</span><span begin="50.390" end="50.878">次</span><span begin="50.878" end="51.404">的情</span><span begin="51.404" end="51.843">丝</span><span begin="51.843" end="53.185">却断不了</span></p><p begin="53.600" end="57.079" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.600" end="54.398">百转千</span><span begin="54.398" end="55.086">折 它</span><span begin="55.086" end="55.492">将</span><span begin="55.492" end="56.114">我围</span><span begin="56.114" end="57.079">绕</span></p></div><div begin="57.620" end="1:13.370" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="57.620" end="1:01.138" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="57.620" end="58.061">有人</span><span begin="58.061" end="58.529">问</span><span begin="58.529" end="59.107">我你</span><span begin="59.107" end="59.536">究</span><span begin="59.536" end="1:00.086">竟是</span><span begin="1:00.086" end="1:01.138">哪里好</span></p><p begin="1:01.317" end="1:04.793" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:01.317" end="1:02.152">这么多</span><span begin="1:02.152" end="1:02.549">年</span><span begin="1:02.549" end="1:03.075">我还</span><span begin="1:03.075" end="1:03.590">忘</span><span begin="1:03.590" end="1:03.843"